{"title":"2011 USAMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Fortieth <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USAMO\">USAMO</a></b> was held April 27th and April 28th, 2011. The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems\">2011 USAMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">2011 USAMO Problems/Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2011 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2011 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/